      "1": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "CROSS\nThis node procedurally generates a cross shape. The size, thickness and roundness can be manipulated. By turning the roundness all the way up you can generate some rhombus shaped stars as well.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n\n• The Sine Oscillator moves from 0 to 1 (set to unipolar in the inspector).\n• This modulates the roundness of the cross.\n• The Shape Render is used to render the Shape2D into a Texture so that it can be outputted.\n"
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 211.6429901123047,
          "width": 796.7196044921875,
          "x": 108.67913818359376,
          "y": 150.6698760986328
        },
        "class": {
          "id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
          "version": 0
        },
        "clock": "video",
        "constants": {},
